<title>USA: Ultrexx names Tobin as CFO.</title>
<headline>Ultrexx names Tobin as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultrexx Corp said Peter Tobin will serve as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Tobin is a certified fraud examiner, a certified public accountant and a member of the Institute of Internal Auditors. He held senior management positions at Ogilvy and Mather Group, Frostman Little and Co., and W.R. Grace and Co.</p>
<p>A spokesman was not immediately available to disclose further details.</p>
